<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila overnight mkt flat but rates seen rising.</title>
<headline>Manila overnight mkt flat but rates seen rising.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>---------------------- April 17 -------------------------</p>
<p>*Central Bank raises 6-mth rrp rate to 10.5625 pct</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Manila overnight money was flat at an average of 10.03125 percent on Thursday but banks remained cautious in case liquidity tightens when banks remit income tax payments next week, dealers said.</p>
<p>Rates remained in the band of 10.25 to 10.03125 percent as volume fell to 13.632 billion from 18.184 billion pesos.</p>
<p>The market was marked with 28 lenders and 14 borrowers.</p>
</text>
